From 60257104e1c098a4b05977a79fba07b374460e1d Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Jason Perlow <jperlow@gmail.com>
Date: Sat, 11 Jul 2026 20:50:51 -0400
Subject: [PATCH] media: cix: sync VPU driver with upstream v1.0.2

Map the p1_7.0_v1.0.1..p1_7.0_v1.0.2 standalone driver delta from driver/ into drivers/media/platform/cix/ while retaining the existing Linux 7.2 compatibility changes.

The DSM-only Kbuild/header changes are omitted because the in-tree port does not carry mvx_dsm.c or mvx_dsm.h. The vb2 wait callbacks were already correctly version-gated by the 7.2 port.

Preserve mainline clock guards and the reset-before-clock / deassert-before-IRQ ordering. Add the v1.0.2 probe completion barrier, Sky1P BUSCTRL split cap, core-mask/register fixes, scheduler idle synchronization, firmware mapping changes, protocol updates, and logging/control additions.

Upstream-Status: Backport [cixtech vpu_driver p1_7.0_v1.0.2, commit 5b9b07b44abc]
